WEBVTT

00:09:58.594 --> 00:10:01.305
rather than relying
on the high priests and priestesses

00:10:01.347 --> 00:10:04.099
to write AI systems for everyone else,

00:10:04.141 --> 00:10:06.560
we can start to empower every accountant,

00:10:06.602 --> 00:10:07.895
every store manager,

00:10:07.936 --> 00:10:12.900
every buyer and every quality inspector
to build their own AI systems.

00:10:13.859 --> 00:10:16.278
I hope that the pizzeria owner

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.822
and many other small
business owners like him

00:10:18.864 --> 00:10:21.367
will also take advantage
of this technology

00:10:21.408 --> 00:10:24.828
because AI is creating tremendous wealth

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.206
and will continue to create
tremendous wealth.

00:10:27.247 --> 00:10:30.167
And it's only by
democratizing access to AI